  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>免责声明</strong></span>：此模组已被取代，并将作为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oaks-bits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oaks Bits and Bops</a> 继续更新。</span></strong><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rIuYlS8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1120\" height=\"35\"></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">📖<strong>简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Oaks Decor v2 是建筑师和室内设计师的完美装饰模组。它添加了大量全新的装饰性与功能性方块，以丰富您的 Minecraft 世界。这些新方块完美契合 vanilla+ 的美学风格。</span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rIuYlS8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1120\" height=\"35\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">✅ <strong>2.0.0 版本特性：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">完全从底层重构。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">全面更新的模型与原版风格纹理</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\">现已包含 Oaks Paintings 的所有画作</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\">悬挂盆栽，为您的建筑增添点缀</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rIuYlS8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1120\" height=\"35\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400\">❓ <strong>开发者说明：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">- 适配 1.1* 版本需要时间。</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em style=\"font-size:14px\">- <strong>我是独立开发者</strong>，因此请对<strong>任何更新和修复</strong>保持<strong>耐心</strong>，因为它们可能需要一些时间。</em></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong><em>社交媒体：</em></strong></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>Sketchfab</strong>：&nbsp;</span></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://sketchfab.com/ContinuedOak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">https://sketchfab.com/ContinuedOak</span></em><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">\\</span></em></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>Planet Minecraft</strong>：</span></em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252foak-s-decor%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/mod/oak-s-decor/</span></em></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>YouTube</strong>：</span></em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKu7Na90-RFfGdhwy2ppF1g/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/c/ContinuedOak/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>网站</strong>：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oaks-decor/settings/oakmods.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">oakmods.com</a></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rIuYlS8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1120\" height=\"35\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>作品展示</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Angelbee：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5yTo8gPGAag?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>其他下载</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>其他下载：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252foak-s-decor%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft 版本</a>：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>其他模组：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://beta.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oaks-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oaks Advancements</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oaks-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oaks Enchantments</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oaks-enchantments-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oaks Enchantments Backport (1.16.5)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oaks-nature\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oak's Nature</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>&nbsp;推荐模组</strong>：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>推荐模组：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items</a></p>\n</div>",
